{"v":1,"id":"e0e4e60fc8fd","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"(Intro build up)","s":8.5,"e":9.88},{"t":"(Verse 1)","s":9.42,"e":14.48},{"t":"I ran the road that was wide,","s":14.56,"e":18.75},{"t":"Chasing dreams that never satisfied.","s":18.79,"e":22.58},{"t":"Every promise faded fast,","s":22.62,"e":24.65},{"t":"I was living for a moment that couldn’t last.","s":24.77,"e":31.05},{"t":"Then in the quiet of my doubt,","s":31.12,"e":33.35},{"t":"I felt Your love reach through the crowd.","s":33.47,"e":35.47},{"t":"You didn’t turn Your eyes away,","s":35.55,"e":38.18},{"t":"You called my name, You made a way.","s":38.26,"e":40.85},{"t":"(Pre-Chorus)","s":40.52,"e":41.47},{"t":"When I was lost and far from home,","s":41.48,"e":43.78},{"t":"You were closer than I’d known.","s":43.8,"e":45.07},{"t":"Grace was waiting where I stood,","s":45.09,"e":47.97},{"t":"You are faithful, You are true.","s":48.03,"e":51.37},{"t":"(Chorus)","s":49.69,"e":51.63},{"t":"You found me, YahuShua,","s":51.68,"e":53.9},{"t":"Right where I was broken.","s":53.98,"e":55.79},{"t":"You held me, never let me go,","s":55.85,"e":58.3},{"t":"Your love has spoken.","s":58.4,"e":60.17},{"t":"I’m standing in Your open arms,","s":60.2,"e":62.75},{"t":"No fear, no shame, no chains on me.","s":62.83,"e":64.97},{"t":"You found me, oh Lord,","s":65.03,"e":67.14},{"t":"And now I’m finally free.","s":67.22,"e":69.64},{"t":"(Verse 2)","s":69.26,"e":74.2},{"t":"The world said I should prove my worth,","s":74.22,"e":78.85},{"t":"Carry the weight, earn my place on earth.","s":78.91,"e":82.18},{"t":"But You said, “Come just as you are,”","s":82.22,"e":84.39},{"t":"You healed my heart and raised the bar.","s":84.44,"e":87.08},{"t":"Every scar says who You are,","s":87.11,"e":89.08},{"t":"Mercy written in the dark.","s":89.16,"e":91.06},{"t":"You traded crowns for wounded hands,","s":91.12,"e":95.55},{"t":"So I could live inside Your love.","s":95.63,"e":98.54},{"t":"(Pre-Chorus)","s":98.2,"e"